# HIRAM issue with Release 20241227

- Source URL: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/ao486_MiSTer/issues/177

HIRAM does not seem to work in the latest release (20241227).

For example, the top300 image with the previous core release in HIRAM mode had  627K of base memory:

The exact same image and settings with the latest core release results in only 529K, with nothing being loaded into upper mem:

This prevents many games to load. EMM386 and QEMM memory modes seem to work fine. Only HIRAM seems affected. At least two users have confirmed this issue with different DOS versions (6.2.2 and Win98 embedded DOS)

Could this be related to the recent commit  #169 ?

